          "text": "Around 1170 Hasheh tutored Shallan Davar at the Davar estates in Jah Keved. An expert in languages, she taught Shallan some Azish and etiquette, and scolded her for poor posture.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "45" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "She left suddenly after one of Lin Davar's violent outbursts against Malise; she was one of several tutors who quit because of Lin, and Shallan remembers them as stern matrons.",
